{"id":"vod_md_6099","vodId":"6099","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"暗杀教室","name_cn":"暗杀教室","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"22集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231019-1/c16b61be10dd3d4162a041f38f141e87.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在椚丘中学三年E班，表面上，这是一个普通的班级，然而实际上，这里聚集着的均是技艺高超冷酷无情的杀手。每一年，他们通过特殊渠道接收着来自世界各地的暗杀任务，替各国首脑“排忧解难”，而这一次，他们有了一个统一的目标——刺杀班主任杀老师（福山润 配音）。杀老师是一个神奇的存在，它的外表并非人类，却有着及其敏感的神经和及其迅速的反应力，没有人知道它从哪里来，也没有人知道，它为何会变成三年E班的班主任。因为想要毁灭地球，杀老师成为了暗杀名单上的高价悬赏人物，而作为三年E班的学生，只要成功消灭杀老师，即可毕业。就这样，围绕着这位神秘的老师，充满了危险的日常就此展开。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-10-19 07:33:09","playable":true,"episodeCount":22,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231018/Hkchkp7D/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231018/jI1WOaog/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231018/60IdPStu/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231018/uGgG3wjT/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231018/fpdGqIqe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231018/93NEXP7f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231018/YpGHKIje/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231018/Mr4N4G44/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231018/P9HXw3gH/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231018/RcxswqG8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231018/DGu9Q9Rt/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231018/rFT41KYh/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231018/P00n46UR/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231018/WYXoVW0t/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231018/S48v5rGA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集